  ],
  "notes": "No speech (a song plays) and no amounts on screen, so every amount is my estimate from the pictures (about 5 paneer slabs of 40 g each; milk is about 1 cup from the glass bottle). No salt is shown in the video: add to taste. Dark specks in the sauce may be black pepper; I only list chilli flakes and dried herbs. The first 5 seconds are the creator taking veggies from the fridge (onion and tomatoes also appear on the board but are never cut or cooked, so I left them out). Flame level and cooking times are not shown. The soft blob melted in the second step looks like butter. Rice is already cooked; the second pan uses oil (could be butter). The face-cam and intro shots are not used."
 },
